      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your perception of suffering as an evolutionary glitch is a common point of debate, but conscious pain often serves a vital role in motivation and survival by warning us of immediate danger. Even if the universe appears indifferent, human resilience and the capacity for meaning-making can transform raw experience into profound personal value rather than just a meaningless loop. Many find that acknowledging this absurdity is the very first step toward consciously choosing how to derive purpose from our unique biological perspective.",
